# Backend API Base URL
# - In local development: leave empty to use Vite proxy (/api -> http://localhost:8000)
# - In production with separate backend (e.g. Render/Railway): https://your-backend-service.onrender.com/api
# - In fullstack Vercel serverless: leave empty or set to /api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
